h the bands Sorrow Plagues, De La Nostalgie and Elderwind. Co-released in digipack CD and double white vinyl with Flowing Downward record label!"}, {"dato": "Formación del proyecto: L (todos los instrumentos y coros), Putrefactus (guitarras rítmicas y sintetizadores de fondo) y J.A (voz).", "url": "https://dreamsofnature.bandcamp.com/album/mater-nature-excelsa", "cita": "L - All Instruments / Backing Vocals.\nPutrefactus: Rhythmic Guitars, Backing Synths.\nJ.A - Vocals"}]}
